 n francophone. 'I work here since 2020' est faux\, c'est 'I HAVE BEEN wo
 rking here since 2020'.\n\nRevoir : valeurs du present simple (habitudes
 \, verites generales)\, du present continu (action en cours\, changement
 \, agacement)\, et surtout le PRESENT PERFECT (lien present-passe\, sinc
 e / for / already / yet / just).\n\nDouble usage : preparation Bristol +
  epreuve (coeff 3).
