UID:5fe08f461e3a0ed1a8a3661ccbf5399f@fuf-romain
SEQUENCE:21
DESCRIPTION:Can / could\, may / might\, must / have to\, should / ought t
 o\, would.\n\nDeux points a soigner : les degres de certitude (must = qu
 asi-certain\, may / might = possible\, can't = impossible)\, et les form
 es passees (must have done\, should have done\, could have done) qui per
 mettent de nuancer un jugement.\n\nDouble usage : preparation Bristol + 
 epreuve (coeff 3).
END:VEVENT
