BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Anglais - Gerondif ou infinitif
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261204T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261204T085000
DTSTAMP:20260809T120000Z
UID:13ca5b6a9c4515da17660ad0f4b5337f@fuf-romain
SEQUENCE:21
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy DOING vs want TO DO. Certains verbes changent de sens :
  remember to do (penser a faire) vs remember doing (se souvenir d'avoir 
 fait).\n\nRevoir aussi le gerondif apres preposition : 'without saying'\
 , 'instead of going'.\n\nDouble usage : preparation Bristol + epreuve (c
 oeff 3).
END:VEVENT
